creature BankAccount
  traits
    owner is text
    balance is a number
  end traits

  when born with (owner)
    give self the trait owner to owner
    give self the trait balance to 100
    say "Account opened for " + owner + " with balance " + self balance
  end born

  action deposit
    # Simulating depositing a fixed amount of 50
    give self the trait balance to self balance + 50
    say self owner + " deposited 50. New balance: " + self balance
  end action

  action withdraw
    # Simulating withdrawing 30
    when self balance > 29
      give self the trait balance to self balance - 30
      say self owner + " withdrew 30. New balance: " + self balance
    otherwise
      say self owner + " tried to withdraw 30, but has insufficient funds!"
    end when
  end action
end creature

bring AliceAccount to life as BankAccount with ("Alice")

AliceAccount does deposit
AliceAccount does withdraw
AliceAccount does withdraw
AliceAccount does withdraw
AliceAccount does withdraw
AliceAccount does withdraw
